# M14 "Pazar", flow "two_clients_shop" side B: a Kargan follows the Aydor of side A (two_shop_a.voscript)
# to the potion seller and watches it drink: the green "+<hp>" floats over A here as well (ITEM_USED to
# the observers, PROTOCOL_SHOP.md §8.4). B then sits down to tell A it is done.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m14_two_b
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.2
clickon create.name
text Seyirci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown 1800
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene markremote Icici
# A sells at the smith, buys at the potion seller and sits down there: then go to it.
waitfor world+remotesitting 3600
scene walktoremote Icici 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene log
# A walk can give up at a corner (blocked for 0.5 s, seen in full runs only): ask once more from where it stopped.
scene walktoremote Icici 4
wait 5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene log
waitfor world+remotenear8 600
# fix1: A sits: its name label hangs at its seated head here too.
scene expectremotelabellift Icici 0.5 1.45
scene camera at:Icici@70 18 5
wait 5
screenshot ui_30_other_seated_label.png
scene camera at:Icici 24 6
waitfor world+otherpotions1 3600
wait 4
screenshot b01_other_drinks.png
# fix1: the remote drinker played its drink clip here too.
expect world+drinks1
expect world+otherpotions1
scene stance sit
waitfor world+serversitting 300
wait 30
quit
